Vendored, unmodified apart from one include path, from the radiance-exl3 extension (Apache-2.0,
Copyright 2026 Dylan Johnston; branch ds41-exl3 in ~/gpu/ds41/exl3/radiance-exl3):
  exl3_abi.h       include/exl3_abi.h      (op schemas, operand positions, interface version)
  exl3_encoding.h  include/exl3_encoding.h (the canonical exl3 encoding; "../common/" dropped)
  exl3_decode.h    common/exl3_decode.h    (declarations; the block uses the inline helpers only)
rad_block_moe_fp8.h reads a layer's EXL3 encoding and issues the extension's whole-expert ops
(moe_exl3_gate_up, moe_exl3_down) by their positions here. Re-copy them when the extension's
interface version moves (EXL3_IFACE_VERSION).
